### Create a new Staff member
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/lunch/Staff
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:password

{
    "name": "Jane Cooper",
    "notification": true
}

### Get all Staff members (to find an ID)
GET http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/lunch/Staff
Authorization: Basic bob:password

### Delete a Staff member (Replace <ID> with an actual UUID)
DELETE http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/lunch/Staff(a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890)
Authorization: Basic alice:password

### Grant Admin Role to a user
POST http://localhost:4005/odata/v4/lunch/grantAdminRole
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic alice:password

{
    "userEmail": "jane.cooper@example.com"
}
